            </note>
            <note corresp="#d44-f2" n="2" xml:id="d44-f2-content">
                <p>The meeting began at 4:40 p.m. and lasted until almost 5:30. Robert Johnson also
                    attended. Johnson Library, Rusk Appointment Book) No record of the meeting has
                    been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d44-f3" n="3" xml:id="d44-f3-content">
                <p>Not attached to the source text. A copy of the table of contents and the draft
                    report is in Department of State, S/P Files: Lot 70 D 199, Vietnam.</p>
            </note>
